WEBVTT

00:13.028 --> 00:16.231
You brought your tray of silver plate. You

00:16.251 --> 00:19.773
thought you'd open up the gate. You showed me

00:19.813 --> 00:23.997
powder on a glass. You thought you had a man of

00:24.057 --> 00:28.520
class. It was just, it was just a lie. So I wiped it

00:28.560 --> 00:32.123
clean and I watched you die. You called it art.

00:32.243 --> 00:35.526
You called it style. It was just garbage in a

00:35.566 --> 00:36.647
filthy pile.

00:40.247 --> 00:43.730
You held your clipboard like a gun You thought

00:43.750 --> 00:47.254
the battle was already won You crossed the line,

00:47.274 --> 00:50.196
you showed your hand You'll never ever

00:50.517 --> 00:54.921
understand It was just, it was just a lie So I

00:54.981 --> 00:58.504
wiped it clean and I watched you die You called it

00:58.704 --> 01:02.468
art, you called it style It was just garbage in a

01:02.488 --> 01:03.449
filthy pile

01:26.960 --> 01:31.704
It was just, it was just a lie So I wasn't clean and

01:31.884 --> 01:35.287
I wasn't your guy You called it out, cause you're

01:35.367 --> 01:36.808
okay It was just garbage

